{"id":"n61056-1-7","stage":5,"title":"비겁하다 · 胆怯","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61056-1-7-1","ko":"전 훔치지 않았어요.","zh":"我没偷啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"전","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"훔치지","meaning":"偷，盗，盗取","explanation":"훔치다：偷，盗，盗取；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"훔치다","audio":"/audio/e7f0ceb36466c81e3510.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87746","senseId":"1","lemma":"훔치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않았어요.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"e7f0ceb36466c81e","term":"훔치다","zh":"偷，盗，盗取","audio":"/audio/e7f0ceb36466c81e3510.mp3","entryId":"87746","definition":"统统拿走别人的东西，当做自己的。","pronunciation":["훔치다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/31154eab7f227e121fe5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61056-1-7-2","ko":"야, 이 비겁한 놈아! 너도 훔쳤으면서 왜 거짓말을 해?","zh":"喂，你这个胆小鬼！你自己也偷了，为什么还要撒谎？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"야,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"야：喂","readings":[{"term":"야","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58149","senseId":"2","lemma":"야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비겁한","meaning":"胆怯，怯懦","explanation":"비겁하다：胆怯，怯懦；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"비겁하다","audio":"/audio/b6fe2698e8870bea8030.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61056","senseId":"1","lemma":"비겁하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놈아!","meaning":"家伙","explanation":"놈：家伙；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"놈","audio":"/audio/8cb9618fb00ec4c42e61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74193","senseId":"1","lemma":"놈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"훔쳤으면서","meaning":"偷，盗，盗取","explanation":"훔치다：偷，盗，盗取；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"훔치다","audio":"/audio/e7f0ceb36466c81e3510.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87746","senseId":"1","lemma":"훔치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거짓말을","meaning":"谎言","explanation":"거짓말：谎言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"거짓말","audio":"/audio/a142bcee838500ead54b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28444","senseId":"1","lemma":"거짓말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해?","meaning":"做出，作出","explanation":"하다：做出，作出；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"3","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08945f015d460ad9","term":"야","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3","entryId":"58149","definition":"大人叫孩子时，或者年龄相等的人之间招呼时用的词语。","pronunciation":["야ː"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"b6fe2698e8870bea","term":"비겁하다","zh":"胆怯，怯懦","audio":"/audio/b6fe2698e8870bea8030.mp3","entryId":"61056","definition":"所作所为不够堂堂正正或不够勇敢。","pronunciation":["비ː거파다"]},{"id":"8cb9618fb00ec4c4","term":"놈","zh":"家伙","audio":"/audio/8cb9618fb00ec4c42e61.mp3","entryId":"74193","definition":"(贬称)男人。","pronunciation":["놈"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"e7f0ceb36466c81e","term":"훔치다","zh":"偷，盗，盗取","audio":"/audio/e7f0ceb36466c81e3510.mp3","entryId":"87746","definition":"统统拿走别人的东西，当做自己的。","pronunciation":["훔치다"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"a142bcee838500ea","term":"거짓말","zh":"谎言","audio":"/audio/a142bcee838500ead54b.mp3","entryId":"28444","definition":"把非事实的事情编造成事实一样说的话。","pronunciation":["거ː진말"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做出，作出","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"露出某种表情或表现出某种态度等。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/402425c34cc89803aad9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.584,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61056","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":174,"sequenceScore":3.4107,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["喂，你这个胆小鬼！你自己也偷了，为什么还要撒谎？","事情都快办成了却搞砸了，一定很难受吧。","我没偷啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["喂，你这个胆小鬼！你自己也偷了，为什么还要撒谎？","我没偷啊。","事情都快办成了却搞砸了，一定很难受吧。"],"answer":0}]}
